[00:20.64]1. The heavens tell the glory of Jehovah.
[00:28.41]The work of his own hand,
[00:33.41]we see in skies above.
[00:41.95]And each new day brings to him rightful praise.
[00:51.95]The starlit night proclaims his might,
[01:12.76]His wisdom, and his love.
[01:17.96]2. Jehovah’s law is perfect, life-restoring,
[01:23.16]And his reminders guide
[01:28.60]the steps of old and young.
[01:37.60]His rulings prove to be true, right, and just.
[01:44.01]His word is sure, his law so pure,
[01:51.69]So sweet upon the tongue.
[01:59.61]3. The fear of God is pure and lasts forever.
[02:09.91]The worth of his commands
[02:15.15]exceeds the finest gold.
[02:19.87]His orders lead and preserve all his own.
[02:29.87]His honor, fame, and holy name,
[02:42.91]We loyally uphold.